  "name": "Fatty Acid Content of Kittiwakes",
  "description": "Fatty acid content will be removed from both types of Kittiwakes using a Folch extraction, then tissues will be stored in chloroform. An NPMR project\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Data to support NPMR project \"Assessing diets of marine mammals using fatty acid.\"",
